{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/9f425d8c8098413d0bd7309a3e4dd7b2.poster.avif?t=1774294187\" width=920 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/9f425d8c8098413d0bd7309a3e4dd7b2.webm?t=1774294187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/9f425d8c8098413d0bd7309a3e4dd7b2.mp4?t=1774294187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Untold Memories: Potter\u2019s Field</strong> is a cinematic psychological horror game built around themes of guilt, memory, and redemption.<br>Years ago, Mark caused the death of a young child in a tragic accident. Since that night, his life has been consumed by silence.<br>Living alone in a small apartment, he struggles under the weight of his past and the burden of survival.<br>Debts grow, time runs out... and just as everything begins to collapse, a mysterious job offer changes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By accepting it, Mark unknowingly opens the door to his own nightmare.<br>Buried memories begin to resurface not just to remind him, but to demand retribution. <br>Some memories never stay buried...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/e25500c145caad781722c3063a70fde0.poster.avif?t=1774294187\" width=920 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/e25500c145caad781722c3063a70fde0.webm?t=1774294187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/e25500c145caad781722c3063a70fde0.mp4?t=1774294187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance &amp; Survival:</strong> You are the eyes of the cemetery. Monitor the <strong>security camera system</strong> to track paranormal activities and looming threats. Information is your only weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A story-driven nightmare where Mark\u2019s tragic past bleeds into reality. Distinguish between actual danger and the tricks of a fractured mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Night Watch:</strong> Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, experience a hyper-realistic cemetery environment with dynamic lighting and chilling sound design that will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation &amp; Exploration:</strong> Venture out of the safety of your guard booth to maintain the grounds. Uncover notes, objects, and secrets that reveal the dark history of Potter's Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling:</strong> Witness the slow unraveling of Mark's reality in a cinematic narrative about guilt, memory, and the terrifying price of redemption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/358f5157609b47780be9c44da1e7815a.poster.avif?t=1774294187\" width=920 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/358f5157609b47780be9c44da1e7815a.webm?t=1774294187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/extras/358f5157609b47780be9c44da1e7815a.mp4?t=1774294187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Animal lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/84773e3e4271abbb10f79acd834140450d0cc69e.jpg"},{"name":"Mechanic ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/574ecee19319076f2e6f765f352ad94d67c658b9.jpg"},{"name":"Home sweet home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/7991ec553b2d96688107b711b7758e2e32b9cc9c.jpg"},{"name":"Warm place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/fe053b89b4ffb9934a58576998339164ce443482.jpg"},{"name":"Bright","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/469790470cd2f084b8e4e3a37d23bef2d5747d30.jpg"},{"name":"Among the dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/8d480925be8a834180931f9ac7e44b39acf936c8.jpg"},{"name":"Goosebumps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/042b6a9a49dbc2f83dc1e3139c6d5c3ed07da489.jpg"},{"name":"Worth a Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/760941decd8d8a76079d688b16a550b16db93d72.jpg"},{"name":"Potter's Field","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3954970/23029c206accca229c309c17908fa7ff8d5d318f.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954970?t=1774294187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954970?t=1774294187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/ed6f70dc07df1b6c657ae9ee04152d3e170c2505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774294187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954970/ed6f70dc07df1b6c657ae9e